OL,3,GNEWSAUK government declines Stormont
OL,4,ABrake for second time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government has for a second time
OL,7,Fdeclined to use the Stormont Brake.
OL,9,FUnionist parties had asked the
OL,10,FSecretary of State to use the
OL,11,Fpost-Brexit mechanism to block updated
OL,12,FEU customs rules from applying in
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,15,FThe brake is designed to give Stormont
OL,16,Fthe power to object to amendments to EU
OL,17,Frules that apply in Northern Ireland.
OL,19,FIt was introduced by the UK government
OL,20,Fin 2023 in attempt to address unionist
OL,21,Fconcerns about the "democratic deficit"
OL,22,Fin NI's Brexit deal.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
